  "body": "*Open Homes canceled- this property is now SOLD unconditionally* \r\n\r\nSome locations never lose their appeal. Some opportunities don't come around very often. And when a home in sought-after Waller Avenue comes to the market for the first time in over four decades, it's worth paying attention.\r\n\r\nPositioned away from the road, this substantial home offers an exciting do-up opportunity in one of Bucklands Beach's most desirable school zones. \r\n\r\nSet on a half share of a sizeable 1,265m2 (more or less) cross-lease site, this property offers an exciting opportunity to secure a sought-after address with ample potential.\r\n\r\nBuilt in 1985 and held by the same family ever since, the home offers generous proportions, original character and the freedom to make it entirely your own.\r\n\r\nAnd that's where the real appeal lies.\r\n\r\nForget paying a premium for somebody else's renovation choices. Bring your own vision, introduce your own style, and create a home that reflects how you want to live.\r\n\r\nWith two generous living areas, three substantial bedrooms, two bathrooms, an oversized double garage with workshop space and a private outdoor entertaining area, there's plenty here to work with.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to modernize a family home or simply recognize the opportunity to secure the right address, this property deserves your attention.\r\nAnd let's talk about location.\r\n\r\nBucklands Beach remains one of East Auckland's most sought-after neighbourhoods, celebrated for its coastal lifestyle, established community and highly regarded schools.\r\n\r\nZoned for Bucklands Beach Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College, this is a location where families aspire to put down roots.\r\nFor more than 40 years, one family has called this place home. Now, for the first time since 1985, the opportunity belongs to someone else.\r\n\r\nThe location is sought-after. The do-up potential is exciting. The opportunity is yours.\r\n\r\nSelling by Auction. Make your move.\r\n\r\nAuction: Bucklands Beach Yacht Club on Tuesday 27 October 2026 at 6:00PM (unless sold prior).",
